              "column": 3
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Hypothyroidism—atrophy of type 2 fibers; may see an increase in type 1 fibers; may see periodic acid–Schiff (PAS)-positive deposits and nemaline rod bodies.",
